//! Empirical Adversarial Challenge Test Suite for Phase 2 Milestone 2: Telemetry Decoders.
//!
//! Rigorously stress-tests:
//! 1. Truncated slice boundary sweeps across all decoders (OSD 0..52, Home 0..45, Gimbal 0..6, RC 0..9, Battery 0..9/0..33)
//! 2. Extreme floating-point values: coordinates near ±90°/±180°, supersonic velocities (Mach 9+), stick deflections beyond [364, 1684]
//! 3. Active-low failsafe verification under inverted bit patterns (all 32 single-bit masks, inverted masks, checkerboard patterns)
//! 4. Battery Variant A vs B boundary transitions (lengths 32, 33, 34, 35) and missing cell slots / sentinel handling
//! 5. Comprehensive fuzzing of decoders AND all helper methods to guarantee zero panics
//! 6. `#![deny(unsafe_code)]` compliance verification

